pseudo-metric. If 𝜂does not depend on the param-
eters of 𝐻, then we have a pseudo-Hermitian sym-
metry.
The pseudo-metric operator defines a nondegen-
erate scalar product in terms of the standard scalar
product of the Hilbert space
