representation of the evolution into one of these LMXB families, the
model should simultaneously reproduce the 𝑀2, 𝑅2, 𝑃orb values, and
the surface composition consistent with the observations. Using the
¤𝑀in evolution estimated from these binary evolutions, we have anal-
