This paper introduces an agentic reward modeling
paradigm designed to enhance the reliability of
automatic solution verification. The methods and
findings presented are intended solely for research
purposes; Our study does not pertain to malicious
applications, unintended uses, or issues related to
fairness, privacy, security, crowdsourcing, or hu-
