B. Compound Processes
Let us formalize the definition of a compound process.
Definition 1. Let (xn)n≥1 be a sequence of i.i.d. variables on G and let (Nt)t≥0 be a homogeneous Poisson counting process
with intensity parameter Λ > 0 which is independent to xn for all t ≥0 and n ≥1. A compound process on G is a process
