B. Weak-link Optimization
Based on the “weak-link” optimization principle, WORC
implements targeted compensation for identified weak agents.
When using the most closely matched weight vector ˆw from
the knowledge base to guide budget allocation, according to
the theory in Section III-A1, a lower numerical value indicates
poorer performance of that agent.
With a total budget of B additional reasoning opportunities,
the allocation formula is:
