On a similar note, the values of uman and utrack are relevant when the controller is in
manual and tracking mode, respectively.
The implementation also consists of both states and parameters. The parameters, e.g.
controller gains and limits, are set externally by some language-dependent unspecified
mechanism, further discussed in section 5. States are used to store controller values
between executions. Complete lists of all arguments, parameters, and states are found
