A. Related Work
PoSW. Cohen and Pietrzak [2] prove traversal of a depth-
robust graph via Fiat-Shamir [22] sampled Merkle proofs.
POSME differs by introducing a mutable arena (not a static
DAG), where the access pattern is data-dependent rather than
fixed, and each node carries a causal hash binding its value to
its write history.
