For the recommended parameters (N=224, d=8, Q=128),
a proof at R=2 opens B=81 blocks (∼8.5 MB). At R=3,
B=657 blocks (∼70 MB). These proofs are post-quantum se-
cure, require no trusted setup, and are generated autonomously
during execution.
