C. TMTO Lower Bound
Write density constraint. Define the write density ρ =
K/N, the expected number of times each arena block is
overwritten during a K-step execution. When ρ < 1, a
constant fraction of blocks are never written; the adversary can
recompute them from the initialization seed at O(1) cost per
block, defeating the storage requirement. Meaningful TMTO
resistance therefore requires:
ρ = K/N ≥1
