cially dilates the wavefront even more leading to a global shape residual ( ˜Rj) that is slightly worse
than the original domain, highlighting a core limitation of the heuristic framework when applied to
wide, non-mass-action signals. It should be noted that this distortion is small despite 4 orders of
magnitude in variation of Bi.
