C. Disentangling Drift with Counterfactual Causes
The optimization objective formalized Eq.4 necessitates
disentanglement of two competing goals: advantageous policy-
induced domain adaptation and versus concept drift arising
from suboptimal policy execution, which are both sampled
from policy π within the time period [i, i + τ]. However,
it is challenging to determine the optimal preferred CoT
and explicitly judge which strategies will cause unpredictable
changes in tokens.
