where M ⪰0.
Define the affine residual
r(x, y, w) := q + Nx + My −w
and infeasibility measure
ϕ(x, y, w) := y⊤w + ∥r(x, y, w)∥.
4.2
Direction subproblem
At iteration v, with rv = r(xv, yv, wv), the direction (dxv, dyv, dwv) solves
min
dx,dy,dw
(∇xfv)⊤dx + (∇yfv)⊤dy + 1
