s.t.
Gx + Hy + a ≤0,
L(x, y, λ) = 0,
λi = 0,
gi(x, y) ≤0,
i ∈J1,
λi ≥0,
gi(x, y) = 0,
i ∈J2.
(9)
Thus each degenerate index is assigned to one branch or the other.
6.3
