A new frequency eν, and frequency derivative ˙eν for the
pulsar, is introduced, defined relative to our clock’s time
rather than GPS time.
Additionally, ∆t is the time
since the mean event time for the day of observation,
∆t = t −¯t. This model will allow effects such as clock
drift to be incorporated into the definitions of eν and
˙eν. A phase offset ϕi, is allowed, relative to the GPS-
on reference interval. These values will be defined rela-
