∆ϕ, and perturb by all of the relevant or marginal local scalar operators Og. These Ogs
are the relevant/marginal scalars appearing in the closure of the OPE algebra generated by
ϕ [35]. We therefore call this the GFF+local construction. Making sure to regularize and
renormalize,
