an move beyond single database NL2SQL.","['Moin Aminnaseri', 'Farima Fatahi Bayat', 'Nikita Bhutani', 'Jean-Flavien Bussotti', 'Kevin Chan', 'Rafael Li Chen', 'Yanlin Feng', 'Jackson Hassell', 'Estevam Hruschka', 'Eser Kandogan', 'Hannah Kim', 'James Levine', 'Seiji Maekawa', 'Jalal Mahmud', 'Kushan Mitra', 'Naoki Otani', 'Pouya Pezeshkpour', 'Nima Shahbazi', 'Chen Shen', 'Dan Zhang']",2026-04-16,0,https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.15233v1,cs.AI,"Conclusion
