RL training of RadAgent
Training pipeline
To train RadAgent, we use the GRPO algorithm17, with rewards as described below.
Specifically, we perform LoRA33 finetuning of our base model (Qwen3-14B25) with rank 16 and alpha 32 on 8
GH200 GPUs. The model was trained with 8 rollouts for each training example, using a batch size of 6 examples
