first large-scale dataset comprising 11K+ profes-
sionally annotated samples, together with a com-
prehensive evaluation suite. Extensive experiments
reveal that current MLLMs struggle with the joint
demands of MCSC, particularly in global planning
and instruction following. The model fine-tuned
on our dataset achieves SOTA performance, and
downstream video generation experiments validate
