Design Objective: Given a request arrival rate 𝜆, our goal is to jointly design the block placement, the
cache allocation, and the load balancing policy so as to minimize the mean response time (including waiting
and processing), while ensuring queue stability.
Remark: In this work, we assume the standard First-Come-First-Serve (FCFS) scheduling to focus on
the above optimizations. Our solution can be combined with optimizations of job scheduling as in [21] for
further improvement, which is left to future work.
