2.2. Motivations and advantages
For a given stochastic process parameter 𝜽, the estimates of the correlation matrix 𝑅, parameters 𝜷, and 𝝈𝟐can be
easily computed. From equation (4) of the correlation matrix elements, it can be found that different 𝜽directly affects
the prediction results of the Kriging model. Moreover, since the estimates of parameters 𝜷and 𝜎are both influenced
by the parameter 𝜽, the primary goal of Kriging modelling is to achieve accurate estimation of 𝜽.
