and 2 practical engineering problems. In addition to the RMSE and MAE used in the previous sections, the coefficient
of determination (R2) was also chosen as a metric for model evaluation. Among these, R2 is used to reflect overall
performance, RMSE indicates global accuracy, and MAE represents the local accuracy of the model. The expressions
