The next step is to use our library to construct discrete weak formulations.
We provide an easy and intuitive interface for the creation of bilinear and linear
forms inspired by FEniCS and the Unified Form Language (UFL),
u = U.trial_function()
v = U.test_function()
def B_form(u, v):
return dot(grad(u, ""+""), grad(v, ""+""))
We also directly support composite spaces
uu = W.trial_function()
vv = W.test_function()
sigma, u, p = uu.components
tau, v, q = vv.components
