2.5. Proof overview and discussion. The proof can be split into two main components.
2.5.1. The linear analysis. In Section 3, we view the source terms ( ˆSk)k∈Z3\{0} in (2.11a) as a black
box and study the family of functions (ϕk)k∈Z3\{0} that solve the Volterra integral equations
ϕk(τ) = sk(τ) +
Z τ
0
