IV. POWER CONSUMPTION OF DIFFERENT SCENARIOS 
In this section the power consumption of some exemplary 
cases described in section II.C is compared. Out of the huge 
amount of system simulation data for each subpanel 
configuration and for 16 simultaneously served UEs the cases 
are compared, where 4 BS at maximum Tx power of 35 dBm 
per BS reach less or similar throughput in the deployment area 
than 8 BS with less Tx power per BS. These are the cases 
shown in TABLE III. 
